  "details": "I have gifted a fair number of VRC+ subscriptions and so have gained badges to reflect this, however now that they are on my profile, I've started having random strangers come up to me begging for it.\n\nI know that I can hide the badge and have done previously but when I cross the next threshold, the next badge then automatically appears publicly on my profile, meaning I have to remember to hide it again.\n\nIt'll be great that when I've disabled this once, I've disabled this for all future tiers.\n\nI'm not against gifting but I am against random begging.",
